<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley ups 3 paper cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley ups 3 paper cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Champion International Corp, Mead Corp and Consolidated Papers Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Champion closed on Friday at 42, Mead closed at 57-3/8 and Consolidated closed at 48-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
